# agy skills, rules, plan mode and bundled extensions, ADR-0040 C8, C9 (stage 5 of the agy spike, 2026-11-12).
# Windows 11, agy 1.5.6, isolated root --gemini_dir=<tmp>\gd (auth from the Windows keyring)
# unless marked WSL. Model: gemini-3.8-flash-low. Paths: <home> = %USERPROFILE%.
# Hook command = <python> -I <tmp>\tools\hook.py <tag> <tmp>\hooks.log; the script appends one
# JSON line per call (event, tool, conversationId, its own cwd) and prints {} (PreToolUse:
# {"decision":"allow"}, or deny when the probe asks for it).

## S1 markers planted (one SKILL.md per candidate root; rules/instructions with a MARKER- word)
repo: .agents/skills, .agent/skills, _agents/skills, .claude/skills, .codex/skills, .gemini/skills,
      .cursor/skills; .agents/rules/r.md; .agents/workflows/marker-ws-workflow.md
home (temp USERPROFILE=HOME=<tmp>\home, no --gemini_dir): ~/.gemini/config/skills, ~/.gemini/skills,
      ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/skills, ~/.claude/skills, ~/.codex/skills, ~/.agents/skills;
      ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md, ~/.gemini/AGENTS.md, ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md,
      ~/.gemini/config/global_workflows/marker-global-workflow.md, ~/.claude/commands/*.md

$ MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 agy -p /skills --model gemini-3.8-flash-low   (0 tokens; names only)
exit=0
